 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "deshalb: so",
     "texto": [
      "**Deshalb** gives the consequence: **Ich war müde. Deshalb bin ich früh gegangen** (I was tired. So I went early). After «deshalb» comes the verb (bin), and the subject comes after it.",
      "Don't confuse it with **weil** (because): with «weil» the verb goes at the end."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "trotzdem: nevertheless",
     "texto": [
      "**Trotzdem** means \"in spite of that\": **Es regnet. Trotzdem gehe ich spazieren** (it's raining. Even so I go for a walk). The verb goes in second position.",
      "Watch out for the false friend: **trotzdem** doesn't mean \"neither\" (that is **auch nicht**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "außerdem: also",
     "texto": [
      "**Außerdem** adds information: **Das Hotel ist schön. Außerdem ist es billig** (the hotel is nice. Also it's cheap).",
      "Like the previous ones, the verb goes in second position."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
